---
/**
 * The 404 is noindex but its links are followed — it is how a crawler that
 * arrives on a dead inbound link finds the live site. It lists the main
 * pages by section; the footer below carries the rest.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Page not found — kitcommerce.store"
  description="That page is not here. The main pages on kitcommerce.store are listed."
  path="/404/"
  noindex
>
  <section class="wrap notfound">
    <p class="notfound-code">404</p>
    <h1>That page is not here</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The link may be from an older version of this site, or it may simply be
      wrong. The main pages are listed below, and the footer has the rest.
    </p>

    <ul class="notfound-links">
      <li><a href="/">Home</a> — both packages, the one-command stack, and which one you want</li>
      <li><a href="/gocommerce/">GoCommerce</a> — the ecommerce backend and admin, in Go</li>
      <li><a href="/svelte-commerce/">Svelte Commerce</a> — the storefront, in SvelteKit</li>
      <li><a href="/svelte-commerce/backends/">Backend integrations</a> — all 26 connectors and their coverage</li>
      <li><a href="/go-svelte-ecommerce/">Architecture</a> — how the two packages fit together</li>
      <li><a href="/gocommerce-svelte-commerce-connector/">Connector status</a> — what is and is not wired</li>
      <li><a href="/features/">Features</a> — checkout, operations and development, checked in the code</li>
      <li><a href="/solutions/">Solutions</a> — marketplace, B2B, direct-to-consumer, multi-store</li>
      <li><a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a> — free, for life</li>
      <li><a href="/compare/">Compare</a> — against Shopify, WooCommerce, Bagisto and the rest</li>
      <li><a href="/svelte-commerce/themes/">Themes</a> and <a href="/live-projects/">live projects</a> — storefronts running now</li>
      <li><a href="/open-source/">Open source</a>, <a href="/vibe-coding-commerce/">vibe-coding commerce</a> and the <a href="/blog/">blog</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/">Go to the home page</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/itswadesh/gocommerce/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Report a broken link</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
